{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786690047472332002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"innovative-dandruffy-deer","assignee":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":5,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e831b6a288129f8e18bb480725901665d0575c6785083d1910b89034c8a5e2f1","event_uuid":"ab6bdfeb-6377-4805-b1b1-6a7cccaef416","position":{"commit_sha":"d826366430650f6db09cc77e65786e07aeabb7fe","position":"1786690023187868001-ab6bdfeb-6377-4805-b1b1-6a7cccaef416"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"fc7159a5683d3311dcf18e32367674dc9292106b27696fc55e59076dd43e94b5","event_uuid":"09338c80-889a-4980-8f8e-44e18a2eb216","position":{"commit_sha":"f4ea073f26319bd7703e1d6f160d84a3b7db0006","position":"1786690034254144001-09338c80-889a-4980-8f8e-44e18a2eb216"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"98bdf50a0071f538af1db02a3945dec91d6d0f8211ed6ad7beb68ff8e00ffc48","event_uuid":"e4f4440b-14a6-4d4d-8a90-c560eed65617","position":{"commit_sha":"e65e162d1ebbdbcf2a9c8a1e4f66359d2cf8a083","position":"1786690042398897001-e4f4440b-14a6-4d4d-8a90-c560eed65617"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"3c6331a8bfb5efbf36133518f58510a0e388e2b60bdf64323d26810691bb5398","event_uuid":"974b510a-ba11-489e-87ae-02d0debb35d4","position":{"commit_sha":"14a249246cbf9c3ba043831b37565981f838053c","position":"1786690046745587001-974b510a-ba11-489e-87ae-02d0debb35d4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"892a8c9a7e805f6345a687b77615e82a71208696cfdbc1ef7ee7948c01015885","event_uuid":"ee1150cc-fd81-4a75-a8f4-7d473278dd72","position":{"commit_sha":"14a249246cbf9c3ba043831b37565981f838053c","position":"1786690047472332001-ee1150cc-fd81-4a75-a8f4-7d473278dd72"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786690023187868001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"09338c80-889a-4980-8f8e-44e18a2eb216","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"cb9c-49cb-5aba-488d"},{"link_uuid":"e4f4440b-14a6-4d4d-8a90-c560eed65617","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3211-be4f-d4aa-4b5c"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe Gerrit Verified matrix intermittently ERRORS during FIXTURE SETUP of tests/unit/test_authorship_batched_ticket_map_7084.py — this time (run 31775418405, py3.13, worker popen-gw1, validating unrelated change 1761) at `git merge -q --no-edit side` with git's output FINALLY captured thanks to change 1619 (the diagnostics fix bug warmthless-dermal-oropendola landed for exactly this purpose):\n\n    error: invalid object 100644 66842fd006b2fdc95ff55a33a263f1cb216bc7d6 for 'aaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd/1005-cccc2222-COMMENT.json'\n    fatal: git write-tree failed to write a tree\n    exit status 128\n\nThis REFINES oropendola's refutation: not a content conflict — the loose blob for the LAST mainline-committed event file is MISSING from the object store two subprocess calls after `git add`+`git commit -q` succeeded on it. A freshly committed object cannot legitimately vanish: this is an object-store integrity fault in the test environment or an env/config leakage between tests, and it will keep blocking UNRELATED changes' Verified votes at random (two distinct tests of this module have now failed the same way).\n\n## Approach\nHypothesis-driven debugging per the /rebar-debug discipline — deterministic reproduction BEFORE any fix. Candidate hypotheses to kill in order:\n(a) env leakage into the fixture's subprocess.run (inherits os.environ): GIT_OBJECT_DIRECTORY / GIT_DIR / GIT_INDEX_FILE / GIT_ALTERNATE_OBJECT_DIRECTORIES set directly (not via monkeypatch) by another test in the same xdist worker earlier, pointing object writes at a directory later removed;\n(b) detached background maintenance (gc --auto autoDetach / git maintenance) spawned by an earlier git call in the same repo pruning or repacking while the fixture continues;\n(c) global git config on the runner (CI's \"Configure git identity\" step or a test writing --global) enabling something destructive;\n(d) pytest tmp_path numbering/truncation collision (dir name truncated to 30 chars + _N suffix) causing two fixtures to share a directory under xdist.\nInstrument first: a conftest or fixture-level guard that on _GitFailed captures `git fsck`, `ls -la .git/objects/**`, the full os.environ GIT_* set, and any concurrent process listing — so the NEXT CI occurrence pins the mechanism even if local reproduction fails. Then fix the CLASS (e.g., scrub GIT_* env in the fixture's _git via env= allowlist, or disable autoDetach maintenance in the fixture repo), with a regression test proving the mechanism.\n\n## Scope\n- tests/unit/test_authorship_batched_ticket_map_7084.py — fixture hardening once the mechanism is proven (env-scrubbed _git and/or maintenance.autoDetach=false), plus any instrumentation that stays useful.\n- possibly tests/conftest.py — worker-level GIT_* leak detector if hypothesis (a) is proven.\n\n## Testing\n- A deterministic reproduction (stress loop under xdist py3.13, or direct injection of the proven mechanism — e.g., set the leaked env var / trigger detached gc — showing the exact 'invalid object' failure).\n- RED->GREEN: the reproduction fails before the fix, passes after.\n- The fix must not weaken what the fixture proves (merge topology, --full-history load-bearing case).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Root cause proven with a deterministic reproduction (not inferred from exit codes); mechanism documented on this ticket.\n- [ ] Fix addresses the class (no retries/recheck-until-green), with a regression test.\n- [ ] `make lint`/`make typecheck` clean; lands via Gerrit (LLM-Review +1 AND Verified +1) before close.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","cb9c-49cb-5aba-488d"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"974b510a-ba11-489e-87ae-02d0debb35d4","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"ee68-5ff4-fa75-4788","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Verified-matrix authorship fixture: freshly committed blob missing at merge (invalid object at write-tree)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ab6bdfeb-6377-4805-b1b1-6a7cccaef416","09338c80-889a-4980-8f8e-44e18a2eb216","e4f4440b-14a6-4d4d-8a90-c560eed65617","974b510a-ba11-489e-87ae-02d0debb35d4","ee1150cc-fd81-4a75-a8f4-7d473278dd72"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786690047472332002,"uuid":"4091c215-02d9-4500-80a9-2c44458e6fcb"}